fixture zone1_11_control_toss_spent_in_dip
doc Control for docs/adr/0015 and BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss (12 s cooldown from the throw): the teaching route with an extra throw and teleport in the dip (ticks 4 and 31). The throw at tick 150 is ignored (the cooldown, 720 ticks, runs from tick 4 to 724), so the chasm is not crossed: the body falls into the pit and the hazard sends it back to the near ledge. A throw spent anywhere before the chasm, or on a failed attempt, costs the next attempt a 12 s wait.
room zone1/11_ember_toss_cancel
frames 250
input
  # The safe first encounter: a tap jump over the dip (128 u wide, 64 u deep) from the arrival
  # point, landing on the near ledge.
  0..3 R
  4 R toss
  5 R
  6..11 R jump
  12..30 R
  31 R toss
  32..46 R
  # The chasm's route: a ground dash from the near ledge (it runs flat past the edge at 20 u/f),
  # the jump on dash frame 7 (a dash-jump), the air jump 47 ticks later, and the air dash
  # up-right 45 ticks after that, as the pit comes up.
  47 R dash
  48..52 R
  53..98 R jump
  99 R
  100..144 R jump
  145 R U jump dash
  146..149 R jump
  # The throw, up-right, on frame 6 of the air dash: the dash goes on.
  150 R U jump toss
  151..185 R jump
  # The teleport to the ember, up near the ceiling over the far side, 16 u above the pit (576 u)
  # on the last tick before the fall reaches it; the body then lands on the far ledge.
  186 R jump toss
  187..249 R
end
expect
  at 4 event.toss=1
  at 31 event.teleport=1
  # The route's own throw finds the toss cooling down: no throw, no teleport, no crossing.
  at 150 event.toss=0 ember=0 toss_cooldown>0
  never 151..249 event.teleport=1
  mark fell 151..249 event.hazard=1
  at fell x<2880u
  never 0..249 x>2880u
  never 0..249 event.room=1
end
